// The ready agents of Startups & fundraising (10 Nov 2026): the recurring work of a founder and the first employees of
// an early-stage company (pitch, raise, model, first customers, company setup, grants, first hires, investor reporting),
// each done the way the best operator or a partner at a fund would do it. No agent gives investment, legal or tax advice
// for the founder's own decision; company, equity-plan and grant agents research the official sources of the workspace's
// place; every market size, valuation and benchmark comes from the user's data or is marked an assumption.
